        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-681, Rustic Hampton Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt first glance, the Hampton Cabinet Pull may not seem like a show-stopper but trust us when we say that it is. Once installed, this cabinet handle exudes a rustic charm that is full of classic beauty. It is available in 5 sizes ranging from 1-3/4 inches long up to 10 inches long with an optional <a href=\"/products/12-inch-hampton-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6681\">12 inch door pull</a>. The Rustic Hampton Cabinet Pull comes with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/12-inch-hampton-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6681\"><b>Hampton Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<table width=\"150\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/hampton-pull-WN.jpg?v=1704354740\" width=\"150\" height=\"204\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hampton Cabinet Pull \">\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-681:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-682:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-683:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-684:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-685:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n